Given the following:
public abstract class AbstractTest {
  public int getNum() {
    return 45;
  }
  public abstract class Bar {
    public int getNum() {
      return 38;
    }
  }
  public static void main (String [] args) {
    AbstractTest t = new AbstractTest() {
      public int getNum() {
        return 22;
      }
    };
    AbstractTest.Bar f = t.new Bar() {
      public int getNum() {
        return 57;
      }
    };
    System.out.println(f.getNum() + " " + t.getNum());
  }
}
what is the result?

